{"about_the_game":"Riders of Asgard is a fun and challenging Viking BMX game. Unlock new maps and items to upgrade your Bike and Rider, and access previously unreachable places. Riders of Asgard features a full single player campaign as well as local multiplayer to take on your friends!<br><br>Riders of Asgard is much more than your average run-of-the-mill, Viking BMX game. It\u2019s a historically correct Viking BMX game, with historically accurate Viking bikes and locations.<br><br><strong>So go ahead! Be the Biking Viking!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose Your Path</strong> - Play the level as you see fit and choose your own path to pull off the best tricks and unlock the special bar.<br></li><li><strong>Choose Your Style</strong> - Use the gold you earn while playing the game to upgrade your bike and viking.<br></li><li><strong>Choose Your Tricks</strong> - While you play, choose your trick-set and use those tricks to earn more points and climb the leader board.<br></li><li><strong>Choose Your Opponents</strong> - Take on the world by competing on the various leader boards, or out trick a friend in Local Multiplayer.<br></li><li><strong>Choose Your Control</strong> - The game has full controller support, and features various Assists you can enable or disable at any time. A controller is recommended but keyboards are also supported.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2fc4919cc7c9a0521c26ee17ce3336442e264b33.jpg","localized_name":"Scholar","name":"Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552370/2fc4919cc7c9a0521c26ee17ce3336442e264b33.jpg"},{"icon":"c14417e352c30e7f8b476f6251d9036d66e69837.jpg","localized_name":"Helmet Cracker","name":"Helmet Cracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552370/c14417e352c30e7f8b476f6251d9036d66e69837.jpg"},{"icon":"05ddbcd36cc9c78555b26d369324ffb9597b1dfc.jpg","localized_name":"Helm